bell.mp3
-------

Source: OpenGameArt “Bell dings/chimes” by qubodup
URL: https://opengameart.org/content/bell-dingschimes
Original file: bell_ding2.wav (public domain)
License: Public Domain

Processing: trimmed to 550ms with fade-out (ffmpeg) so sample duration
is shorter than CHIME_GAP_MS (800ms). Converted to mono MP3.
Bell.re sampleDurationMs must match this trim (550). If you replace
this file, keep the sample shorter than CHIME_GAP_MS and update
sampleDurationMs — armed completeAt uses last start + sample + tail.
